            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.6, letterSpacing: 1 }}>全程没填过一张表单</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', opacity: 0.8 }}>成品演示</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 476, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.18)', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7' }}>「每周一三五下午三点半提醒我站起来活动，顺便锁屏」</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 200, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑥</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>输入一句话</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：输入框里有这句话，<br />顶部模式胶囊可见</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>第一步 · 说</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.7, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>时间、重复说清楚就行。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 200, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑦</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>看解析结果</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：列出 类型 / 时间 /<br />重复 / 系统操作，并标注来源</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>第二步 · 看</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.7, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>四个字段摊开。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 200, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑧</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>点一下加入</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：列表顶部出现新锚点，<br />显示下次触发时间</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>第三步 · 加入</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.7, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>跳到锚点页，已经能用。</Text>
