        <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.12)', border: '1px solid #4FE0B0', borderRadius: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.9 }}>原来要点五六下、还得先学一套说法，现在说一句话就完了。</Text>
